<div class="rr-two"><div class="rr-pale"><ol class="rr-steps"><li><span><b>Email us within 14 days</b>Send your order number and the items to hello@poorly-pet.com.</span></li><li><span><b>We reply with next steps</b>Within one working day, including where to send it.</span></li><li><span><b>Post it back within 14 days</b>Unused, in its original packaging where possible. Keep your proof of postage.</span></li><li><span><b>Get your refund</b>Within 14 days of us receiving it, or your proof of postage.</span></li></ol></div><div class="rr-card"><h3>Faulty, damaged or wrong?</h3><p>Under Irish consumer law, we’ll send a replacement or give you a full refund, including return postage. This covers opened supplements too. Email your order number and a photo if you can.</p><a class="btn sec" href="mailto:hello@poorly-pet.com?subject=Faulty%20item">Tell us about a problem</a></div></div>
