<div class="rr-pale"><div class="rr-qa"><button class="q on" type="button" aria-expanded="true">Who pays for return postage?</button><div class="a on">You do, unless the item is faulty, damaged or not what you ordered. Then we cover it.</div><button class="q" type="button" aria-expanded="false">How long do refunds take?</button><div class="a">Within 14 days of us receiving your return, or proof that you’ve sent it, to your original payment method. Your bank may take a few extra days to show it.</div><button class="q" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Can I return an opened supplement?</button><div class="a">Not if you’ve changed your mind. Supplements, consumable health products and perishable items can’t be returned once opened or if the seal is broken, unless they are faulty. The same goes for made to order items.</div><button class="q" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Can I cancel before it’s dispatched?</button><div class="a">Email us as soon as possible with your order number and we’ll do our best to cancel it. Once it has shipped, you can still return it within 14 days.</div></div></div>
